### Environment Variables
@baseUrl = https://paas-express-worker.pandjirizki029.workers.dev
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:8787

### 1. Healthcheck Database & Worker Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 2. Get All Students
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students

### 3. Search Students (Filter query)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students?q=Radeya

### 4. Get Student by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/1

### 5. Create Student (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Radeya Alea Akbar",
  "class_name": "Sija"
}

### 6. Update Student (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Radeya Alea Akbar, S.Kom.",
  "class_name": "Sija"
}

### 7. Delete Student (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/students/1
